lity.Below is an overview of the technical improvements deployed across our active internal branches, along with the full engine systems unlocking once the gates of Early Access open.Deployed Engine Improvements (Internal","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:20:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038385","verified_at":"2026-10-24T02:23:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4979730-1847286114036330","game_id":"steam-4979730","kind":"announcement","title":"Void Walkers X64:","summary":"\\ Void Walkers X64: Festival Demo to Early Access & BeyondWelcome to all the new initiates, tactical veterans, and players testing the current Steam Next Fest build.Void Walkers X64 is an uncompromising, deterministic 2D-HD tactical JRPG built from the ground up on our bespoke C++17 Direct3D 11 engine. We built this engine without commercial middleware bloat to deliver low-latency, \"on-the-metal\" tactical execution that runs locked down to an integrated GPU baseline (128MB VRAM).Below is the off","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:07:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036330","verified_at":"2026-10-23T15:11:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4979730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4979730":"2026-10-26T15:59:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4979730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:18Z"},"5349870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:1